1
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:05,210
[XYLO] I will find you.

2
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:09,380
Both for me,
and my Knights you doomed.

3
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:11,890
I’ll find you.

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:15,430
The one who was responsible
for Senerva’s fate.

5
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:18,060
I'll find you.

6
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,020
And I will kill you.

7
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:23,150
-[Xylo gasps]
-[TEORITTA] Xylo? Xylo!

8
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:26,150
Were you walking in the land
of dreams, perchance?

9
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:28,740
[grunts]

10
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:31,780
A wisp of a man called Venetim
came calling,

11
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,870
and he requested
that I awaken you.

12
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,370
My work is done.
You may praise me now.

13
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,540
Tell the wisp
I'll be there in a minute.

14
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,170
[TEORITTA] Most unacceptable!

15
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:42,710
You’ll slip back into a slumber
the moment I depart.

16
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,170
[XYLO] Uh-huh.

17
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,380
For shame!

18
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,550
I commend your honesty,

19
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:48,630
but your behavior
is worthy of reproach!

20
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:49,720
Tell me.

21
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,390
Tell you what?

22
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,510
What you’re still doing here.

23
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,970
I assume they told you about me.

24
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,140
[TEORITTA] Uh...

25
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,520
They did.

26
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:02,350
I know you received
the hero penalty,

27
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:05,190
reserved for the most
heinous of crimes.

28
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:06,270
There is more.

29
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:08,440
They enlightened me
on your past, too.

30
00:01:08,490 --> 00:01:10,280
-So why are you--
-You are my knight!

31
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,280
I know you must have
had a good reason.

32
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:15,070
[Xylo sighs]

33
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:16,620
[Xylo scoffs]

34
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:18,330
[XYLO] My reason is irrelevant.

35
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:19,830
I murdered a goddess.

36
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:21,870
That’s the cold, hard truth.

37
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:24,170
Two events can end a pact.

38
00:01:24,210 --> 00:01:25,540
Either the goddess’s death

39
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:27,710
or termination
by mutual consent.

40
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,300
-So simply--
-I refuse.

41
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:30,380
You what?

42
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:31,840
I chose you.

43
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,090
I shall not sever
our sacred bond.

44
00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:35,800
♪

45
00:01:37,010 --> 00:01:38,220
[Xylo sighs]

46
00:01:38,270 --> 00:01:40,430
[VENETIM] Hey, Xylo,
are you awake yet?

47
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,850
Everything’s a complete mess!

48
00:01:41,890 --> 00:01:43,140
If you don’t stop shouting,

49
00:01:43,190 --> 00:01:44,980
I’m going to rip your head off,
Venetim.

50
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:46,270
[Venetim chuckles]

51
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:47,820
[VENETIM] You might
not get the chance.

52
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:49,610
The way things are going,
I’ll be a goner

53
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:51,990
before you get
your vindictive hands on me.

54
00:01:52,030 --> 00:01:53,450
Explain.

55
00:01:53,490 --> 00:01:55,530
[VENETIM] We’ve been assigned
our next mission.

56
00:01:55,570 --> 00:01:57,160
[Xylo sighs] Seriously?

57
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:00,000
[VENETIM] We are
disposable heroes, after all.

58
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,870
Still, I’d very much prefer
not to die,

59
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,120
so could you please

60
00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:05,880
come and help me work out
the details?

61
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,170
Son of a bitch.

62
00:02:07,210 --> 00:02:08,340
[TEORITTA] Take heed, my knight!

63
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:09,670
We must away.

64
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:12,010
You are clearly in need
of my divine strength!

65
00:02:12,050 --> 00:02:13,430
-[thudding]
-[gasps]

66
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,300
-[man shouting]
-What’s this disturbance?

67
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:19,260
[XYLO] Tatsuya and His Majesty.

68
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,600
Pray tell, who might they be?

69
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,980
Well, they're heroes,

70
00:02:24,020 --> 00:02:25,600
just like me.

71
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:29,520
♪

72
00:02:32,650 --> 00:02:34,530
[Teoritta exclaims]

73
00:02:34,570 --> 00:02:37,410
[TEORITTA] Xylo, this vast river
has turned to ice!

74
00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:40,410
I never would've imagined
one of that size could freeze.

75
00:02:40,450 --> 00:02:43,960
My knight, come to my side
and gaze upon it! Hurry!

76
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,330
-Faster still!
-[sighs]

77
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:46,960
[TEORITTA] You must
come quickly and look!

78
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:50,500
[KORMADINO] Your orders.

79
00:02:50,550 --> 00:02:53,550
"The 13th goddess transport
has been suspended.

80
00:02:53,590 --> 00:02:55,680
You are hereby
ordered to clear out

81
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,340
the Zewan Gan Tunnels."

82
00:02:58,010 --> 00:03:00,220
Safe to assume that they have
also been affected

83
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:01,810
by Demon Blight?

84
00:03:01,850 --> 00:03:04,230
You’re aware of what the
Fourth War of Subjugation did.

85
00:03:04,270 --> 00:03:06,600
The appearance
of Demon Blight Number One,

86
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:08,310
the Serpent, was catastrophic.

87
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,820
It corrupted our forests,

88
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:12,530
and even caused the soil
itself to rot.

89
00:03:12,570 --> 00:03:14,530
In the 20 years since
it first arrived,

90
00:03:14,570 --> 00:03:17,870
humanity has lost more than
half of all habitable land.

91
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,950
Whatever the cost,
we must not allow it

92
00:03:19,990 --> 00:03:21,410
to progress any further.

93
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:23,700
To that end, we have
already deployed

94
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:25,580
the hero unit to Zewan Gan.

95
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:27,370
You should be able
to catch up with them

96
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:29,500
quickly on horseback.

97
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,340
We’ll depart at once.

98
00:03:31,380 --> 00:03:33,710
[KORMADINO]
Then I will leave you to it.

99
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:37,890
[door lock clicks]

100
00:03:37,930 --> 00:03:39,800
[KORMADINO]
Oh, and one last thing.

101
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:41,140
Do me a favor,

102
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:42,890
if you run into
High Priest Marlen,

103
00:03:42,930 --> 00:03:44,350
please give him my regards.

104
00:03:44,390 --> 00:03:46,140
I only wish
I could tell him myself.

105
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:47,600
♪

106
00:03:51,270 --> 00:03:53,730
Most curious.
I have seen no sign

107
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:55,780
of that roguish squire
called Dotta.

108
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:58,860
[VENETIM] 'Cause he’s still
laid up in the repair shop.

109
00:03:58,910 --> 00:04:00,740
[NORGALLE]
I’d wager that’s because

110
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:03,450
Xylo beat the tar out of him.
Honestly.

111
00:04:03,490 --> 00:04:05,040
As my loyal subjects,

112
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:07,370
you should be more careful
with the kingdom’s property.

113
00:04:07,410 --> 00:04:08,710
Must've slipped my mind

114
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,380
but I’ll try harder,
Your Majesty.

115
00:04:10,670 --> 00:04:14,300
Pardon, but why do you address
your comrade as a royal?

116
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:15,760
[XYLO] It’s just easier.

117
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,880
Norgalle is convinced
he’s the king

118
00:04:17,930 --> 00:04:19,340
of the Federated Kingdom,

119
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:21,550
and it’s no use trying
to persuade him otherwise.

120
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,720
Huh?

121
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:25,350
[XYLO] He unleashed
a large-scale attack

122
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:27,310
against his
so-called "usurpers."

123
00:04:27,350 --> 00:04:29,690
That’s why he was sentenced
to be a hero.

124
00:04:29,730 --> 00:04:31,110
He was a terrorist.

125
00:04:31,150 --> 00:04:32,270
[Norgalle grunts]

126
00:04:32,310 --> 00:04:33,690
[TEORITTA] Uh...

127
00:04:33,730 --> 00:04:34,940
And him?

128
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:36,650
Who precisely is he?

129
00:04:36,990 --> 00:04:39,950
[XYLO] Tatsuya, I don’t know
what his crime was,

130
00:04:39,990 --> 00:04:42,030
but he’s been serving
in the hero unit

131
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:43,410
longer than any of us.

132
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:46,660
He seems to be
rather detached from this world.

133
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:48,960
Every time
a hero is resurrected,

134
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,420
they lose a part of their mind
and their memory.

135
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:54,040
The same could happen
to the rest of us.

136
00:04:54,090 --> 00:04:55,340
[Teoritta gasps]

137
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:58,340
[XYLO] Damn it all.
This isn’t justice.

138
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,590
It’s a sentence
far worse than death.

139
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:05,060
[Venetim panting]

140
00:05:10,390 --> 00:05:13,310
[VENETIM] There, now.
Look at that.

141
00:05:13,350 --> 00:05:15,270
Another warm welcome.

142
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:16,440
[TEORITTA] Uh...

143
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,780
[XYLO] Let's go.

144
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:18,990
[TEORITTA] Uh...

145
00:05:23,030 --> 00:05:25,950
[TEORITTA] It is as if this town
is under a dismal pall.

146
00:05:25,990 --> 00:05:27,490
[VENETIM]
Can’t really blame them.

147
00:05:27,540 --> 00:05:29,450
They’re on the verge
of being swallowed whole

148
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,540
by the Demon Blight.

149
00:05:34,290 --> 00:05:36,340
[SOLDIER] Your family’s
running out of time.

150
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:39,590
Please. Is there truly nothing
you can do to help our town?

151
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:42,470
I am sorry, but the army's
decision is final.

152
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,970
[VENETIM] How unusual.

153
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:46,890
Normally, everyone
would have been evacuated.

154
00:05:46,930 --> 00:05:49,890
I wonder why
they’re refusing to go.

155
00:05:50,980 --> 00:05:52,310
[Teoritta sighs]

156
00:05:52,850 --> 00:05:55,190
[birds chirping]

157
00:05:57,820 --> 00:06:00,610
-[XYLO] Hey, there, question.
-[WOMAN] Huh?

158
00:06:00,650 --> 00:06:02,530
Are you...

159
00:06:02,570 --> 00:06:04,490
one of those "heroes"?

160
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,280
I swear I’m only here to help.

161
00:06:07,330 --> 00:06:09,540
We came to get
the tunnels under control.

162
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:11,830
I’m hoping you have some
digging tools we could borrow--

163
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:12,870
I don’t get it.

164
00:06:12,910 --> 00:06:14,460
Why bother?

165
00:06:15,210 --> 00:06:18,380
We’re doomed.
It's too late for us.

166
00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:20,630
Why didn’t you come sooner?

167
00:06:22,670 --> 00:06:24,180
[door opens, closes]

168
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:25,970
[Xylo grunts softly]

169
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:27,220
[GIRL] Pardon?

170
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:28,310
[XYLO] Hm?

171
00:06:31,350 --> 00:06:34,190
[XYLO] Get lost.
I’m not here to entertain.

172
00:06:34,730 --> 00:06:37,480
[GIRL] The tunnels
are in that direction.

173
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,780
[XYLO] Thank you.

174
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:48,700
[GIRL] Does this mean
Daddy will come home now?

175
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:51,700
It’s my birthday, after all.

176
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,620
And he promised me
we’d celebrate together!

177
00:06:54,660 --> 00:06:55,750
[gasps softly]

178
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,720
[Xylo grunts]

179
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:05,970
Damn it!

180
00:07:06,090 --> 00:07:10,350
She has no business
looking at me like that.

181
00:07:10,390 --> 00:07:13,470
[VENETIM] The Zewan Gan Tunnels
produce high-quality iron

182
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:15,770
used as a catalyst
in sacred seals.

183
00:07:15,810 --> 00:07:18,060
It seems
Verkle Development Corporation

184
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:20,480
and the military
poured lots of money into it.

185
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:24,110
So, it’s pretty ironic that
their precious tunnels wound up

186
00:07:24,150 --> 00:07:26,410
with a bad faerie infestation.

187
00:07:26,450 --> 00:07:27,740
[TEORITTA] How curious.

188
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:30,700
My knight, tell me more
about these "sacred seals."

189
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:33,370
If you believe the old men
from the Temple,

190
00:07:33,410 --> 00:07:36,370
they’re a product of the wisdom
bestowed on us by the gods.

191
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:37,460
As I am now.

192
00:07:37,670 --> 00:07:40,130
There are only two
my body can utilize.

193
00:07:40,170 --> 00:07:42,130
The rest are useless to me.

194
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:45,090
Tuning sacred seals
is King Norgalle’s specialty.

195
00:07:45,130 --> 00:07:48,050
It may be hard to believe,
but he’s a savant.

196
00:07:48,090 --> 00:07:49,140
He can do things alone

197
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:51,100
that a whole group
would struggle with.

198
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:52,600
If you’re curious,

199
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:55,230
the sacred seal inscribed
on an object

200
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:56,440
is powered by the light

201
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,810
of the glorious sun.

202
00:07:57,850 --> 00:08:00,060
And a person
must use their life force

203
00:08:00,110 --> 00:08:01,980
and will
to invoke the seal’s might.

204
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:04,320
They have various effects
to wield.

205
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,940
Such as summoning lightning,

206
00:08:05,990 --> 00:08:09,740
rending the earth below,
or unleashing brutal heat.

207
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,660
[Teoritta exclaiming]

208
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:15,120
It is exhilarating! Is it not?

209
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:18,620
At ease. Sacred seals alone
aren’t enough to win.

210
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,750
[VENETIM]
They say it was a month ago

211
00:08:20,790 --> 00:08:22,460
that the miners
turned into faeries

212
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:24,960
and started attacking
indiscriminately.

213
00:08:25,130 --> 00:08:27,340
[XYLO]
That’s a Demon Blight for you.

214
00:08:27,550 --> 00:08:29,760
[VENETIM] True,
details are fuzzy at best.

215
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,350
We do know the basics.

216
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:34,220
They’re calling
Number 51, "Lotus."

217
00:08:34,310 --> 00:08:36,520
And we’re on excavation duty.

218
00:08:36,560 --> 00:08:38,100
Our mission is to clear a route

219
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:40,020
so the Holy Knights
can launch an attack.

220
00:08:40,060 --> 00:08:43,110
By the way,
although it pains me to say it,

221
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:44,770
as the acting commander here,

222
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:46,730
I am obligated
to remain in town.

223
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:48,070
Really?

224
00:08:48,110 --> 00:08:49,950
-Is this some kind of joke?
-[VENETIM] And so...

225
00:08:50,110 --> 00:08:52,570
I beseech you with due haste...

226
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:55,910
Proceed inside,
and begin your work!

227
00:08:56,370 --> 00:08:57,790
[Xylo sighs]

228
00:09:01,710 --> 00:09:04,040
[cracking]

229
00:09:04,170 --> 00:09:05,210
[Xylo grunts]

230
00:09:05,710 --> 00:09:08,670
[exhales] We’re either
cutting a path through,

231
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,630
or we’re just digging
our own grave here.

232
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:13,890
[NORGALLE] Come now, I inscribed
those sacred seals myself,

233
00:09:13,930 --> 00:09:15,390
and that’s the best you can do?

234
00:09:15,430 --> 00:09:17,600
I order you to dig faster.

235
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,560
We’re going as fast as we can.

236
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,560
-Right, Tatsu...
-[Tatsuya grunting]

237
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,060
[TEORITTA] Ho-ho-ho!

238
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:24,480
[TEORITTA] You appear
to be struggling

239
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,070
with the task at hand.

240
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:28,030
That being said,

241
00:09:28,070 --> 00:09:30,530
are you, at last,
ready to call upon my power?

242
00:09:30,570 --> 00:09:32,110
[XYLO] Hell, no! [grunts]

243
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,410
This work is beneath you.

244
00:09:34,450 --> 00:09:35,950
I won’t waste your stamina.

245
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:37,240
[TEORITTA] Unacceptable!

246
00:09:37,290 --> 00:09:39,290
I have yet to truly contribute
to this mission!

247
00:09:39,330 --> 00:09:41,290
-Huh?
-How am I to earn your praise

248
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:43,500
if I am not permitted
to aid in your endeavor?

249
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:45,630
[XYLO] Just sit down
and shut your mouth.

250
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:47,250
[Teoritta grunts]

251
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:48,800
[KIVIA] I’m pleased to see
you’re at least attempting

252
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:51,170
to do an adequate job.

253
00:09:51,220 --> 00:09:53,260
Hello, Xylo Forbartz.

254
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:54,800
[Xylo grunts]

255
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:57,220
Slacking off on a mission
would be a quick way to die.

256
00:09:57,470 --> 00:09:58,810
My Goddess.

257
00:09:58,850 --> 00:10:01,730
If you prefer, you are welcome
to rest with our unit.

258
00:10:01,770 --> 00:10:05,060
I refuse. I wish to continue
observing my knight at work.

259
00:10:05,110 --> 00:10:07,400
-It is my right as a goddess.
-[Xylo grunts]

260
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:09,400
-Even so--
-She’s spoken.

261
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,780
The goddess has decided

262
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:12,700
to remain on the front lines
with us.

263
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:16,580
As sovereign of this realm,
I deem your request denied!

264
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:19,540
Uh... Say, Xylo,
what ails this man?

265
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:21,540
Is it perhaps
resurrection madness?

266
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:22,750
It’s all him.

267
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:25,080
-[Norgalle grunts]
-[KIVIA] I see.

268
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:29,880
I was informed that
Dotta Luzulas stole the goddess.

269
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,550
Why didn’t you
explain yourself then?

270
00:10:32,590 --> 00:10:35,390
[chuckles] You never would have
believed me.

271
00:10:36,090 --> 00:10:39,220
And besides,
we didn’t have time to chat.

272
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:41,850
[KIVIA] Don’t withhold intel
in the future.

273
00:10:41,890 --> 00:10:44,350
When we’re on a mission,
you tell me everything.

274
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,850
[XYLO] Good luck with that.

275
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,310
Why should I bother

276
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,570
when you hand out
these kinds of jobs?

277
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:50,820
Meaning?

278
00:10:51,110 --> 00:10:53,450
[XYLO] We’re knee-deep
in a faeried mine.

279
00:10:53,490 --> 00:10:55,820
Normally, they’d just
leave the place alone.

280
00:10:55,860 --> 00:10:58,450
Especially since
it’ll be winter before long.

281
00:10:58,490 --> 00:11:00,080
[KIVIA] What are you getting at?

282
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,740
[XYLO] I don’t know
what the military

283
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:03,160
or Temple folks are thinking,

284
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:05,500
but on its face,
it’s a pointless mission.

285
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:07,420
What’s your true aim?

286
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:09,460
Assuming it’s not just
to torture us

287
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:10,550
for the sheer fun of it.

288
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,880
Hm... Huh?

289
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:19,470
Are you planning to use
Teoritta for something?

290
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,600
Answer.

291
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,140
♪

292
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:25,060
[Kivia scoffs]

293
00:11:25,270 --> 00:11:27,650
Spare me
your conspiracy theories.

294
00:11:27,850 --> 00:11:30,650
Your unit is to carry out
your orders.

295
00:11:34,690 --> 00:11:35,900
Figures.

296
00:11:35,950 --> 00:11:37,410
Infuriating.

297
00:11:37,570 --> 00:11:39,660
Everything about
this damn mission

298
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:41,160
is fishy as hell.

299
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:46,870
-[clanging]
-[Xylo grunting]

300
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:49,750
Huh?

301
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:54,130
-Stay back!
-[Tatsuya growls]

302
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:58,800
[Tatsuya yelling]

303
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,100
[grunting]

304
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,440
Where do you think you’re going?

305
00:12:13,690 --> 00:12:17,240
Limiting explosion damage
won't be easy. Tatsuya!

306
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:21,240
[Tatsuya yelling]

307
00:12:21,490 --> 00:12:23,280
Oh, my. Impressive.

308
00:12:23,330 --> 00:12:24,370
Hmm.

309
00:12:30,380 --> 00:12:32,170
[yelling]

310
00:12:38,050 --> 00:12:40,640
[Tatsuya groaning]

311
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:44,850
My top soldier.
He’s never failed me. Hm.

312
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:46,970
He didn’t even need any backup.

313
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:51,150
But he could probably use
some rest right about now.

314
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:59,990
[NORGALLE] Oh! Despite the
obvious areas of corruption,

315
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:03,160
the surface appears safe enough
for our intended usage.

316
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:05,030
[Norgalle grunts]

317
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:07,450
And so, this shall serve
as the front-line base

318
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:08,830
for the Holy Knights.

319
00:13:08,870 --> 00:13:10,960
You may now go ahead
and begin all construction.

320
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:19,220
-[XYLO] Um... Hm?
-[TEORITTA] Xylo!

321
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:21,550
It is finally my time. Yes?

322
00:13:21,590 --> 00:13:23,260
Allow me to contribute.

323
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:24,640
[XYLO] Settle down.

324
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:26,890
Where shall I plant
this big stake?

325
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:28,430
There? Huh?

326
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,890
Look, my knight,
the corruption has encroached

327
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:32,400
even further over yonder!

328
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,270
[Xylo groans] Hold on a minute.

329
00:13:34,310 --> 00:13:35,730
[footsteps]

330
00:13:38,990 --> 00:13:40,150
[TEORITTA] Uh...

331
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:42,160
[XYLO] Hm.

332
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:44,070
One every three paces.

333
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,030
That’s how you should
place the stakes.

334
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:48,040
From here
until that point there.

335
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:51,210
We’ll tie a rope between them
and make a sacred-seal barrier.

336
00:13:51,250 --> 00:13:53,250
[Teoritta exclaims, chuckles]

337
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:55,590
Great! It shall be done!

338
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:57,170
Now, behold!

339
00:13:57,210 --> 00:13:59,510
As I adeptly complete
the assigned task!

340
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:02,680
Be advised.
I expect ample praise.

341
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,760
[gasps]

342
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,260
-Uh...
-[Xylo sighs]

343
00:14:06,220 --> 00:14:08,310
[XYLO] Just do the best you can.

344
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:10,890
And try not to hurt yourself.

345
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:14,100
[TEORITTA]
What is your next task, Xylo?

346
00:14:14,150 --> 00:14:16,110
Getting the supply chests
set out.

347
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:18,780
All of that has to be in place
before the Holy Knights

348
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:20,280
-arrive here--
-[thudding]

349
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,820
-[TEORITTA] Huh?
-[XYLO] What's that?

350
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:28,370
[Norgalle grunts] I daresay,
some of my finest work.

351
00:14:28,410 --> 00:14:30,080
[Teoritta exclaims]

352
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:32,540
[TEORITTA] Truly magnificent!

353
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:34,080
What is this lovely item?

354
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,540
[gasps]

355
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:40,510
A system that greets
unwelcome visitors,

356
00:14:40,550 --> 00:14:42,260
with remorseless slaughter!

357
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:43,340
I have dubbed it...

358
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:45,340
-The Zolinvolkov.
-[Teoritta stutters]

359
00:14:45,390 --> 00:14:48,640
You know what it means?
The "judge of fools."

360
00:14:49,970 --> 00:14:51,560
Hmm.

361
00:14:51,890 --> 00:14:54,770
Perfect, but how do the Knights
disarm this thing?

362
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:56,810
Take a good look
and you will see.

363
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:59,190
There are parts of the ground
that trigger the attacks,

364
00:14:59,230 --> 00:15:01,530
and other parts
that intentionally do nothing.

365
00:15:01,690 --> 00:15:04,200
But wait, that in itself
is a decoy!

366
00:15:04,450 --> 00:15:07,200
Anyone who is foolish enough
to try to touch the chest

367
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:09,700
will be scorched by the flames
of judgment!

368
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:12,580
The only way to disarm it
is with this key I carry--

369
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:14,750
-[XYLO] Tatsuya!
-What do you think you're doing?

370
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:16,210
Impudent Fiend!

371
00:15:16,710 --> 00:15:17,880
[XYLO] Are you tryingto get

372
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:19,920
the whole strike team
killed or what?

373
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:23,420
Remove everything except
what’s absolutely necessary.

374
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:24,670
[Norgalle grunts]

375
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,800
[grunting] You rogues!

376
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,600
-One thing is clear.
-[Norgalle shouting]

377
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:31,390
These hero types
seem to be most eccentric.

378
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:37,850
[groans] Damn. They’re not gonna
cook through without more heat.

379
00:15:37,900 --> 00:15:39,520
[NORGALLE]
Allow me to fix that.

380
00:15:40,230 --> 00:15:41,360
[gasps]

381
00:15:44,570 --> 00:15:46,910
Do you require
a more powerful flame?

382
00:15:46,950 --> 00:15:49,620
No. That should be good.

383
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:53,120
[Teoritta grunting]

384
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:55,710
[Xylo sighs]

385
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:00,130
[TEORITTA] It is complete!

386
00:16:00,170 --> 00:16:03,000
And even more perfect
than my prior creations!

387
00:16:03,050 --> 00:16:05,590
Shall I make another one
to supplement our meal?

388
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:07,260
Huh? Go ahead.

389
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:08,760
Is it not tasty?

390
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:11,100
I seem to have mastered
the skill known as "cooking"

391
00:16:11,140 --> 00:16:12,310
in no time at all.

392
00:16:12,350 --> 00:16:13,510
Permission granted.

393
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:15,640
[XYLO] If Dotta
or Venetim were here,

394
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,690
we might have gotten
a little more.

395
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,610
I suspect
they’re not fairly dividing

396
00:16:20,650 --> 00:16:22,570
the military ration budgets.

397
00:16:22,610 --> 00:16:23,780
I’ll have some words

398
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,980
with the Minister of Finance
about this.

399
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:27,190
That sounds like a plan.

400
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,700
Once the job is over,
you do that.

401
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,780
It would seem

402
00:16:31,830 --> 00:16:33,790
that our mission is going
exceedingly well thus far.

403
00:16:33,830 --> 00:16:35,120
-Is it not?
-[XYLO] Huh?

404
00:16:35,450 --> 00:16:37,500
[TEORITTA] Are we, at last,
in close proximity

405
00:16:37,540 --> 00:16:38,790
to the demon lord?

406
00:16:38,830 --> 00:16:40,500
[Xylo sighs] Most likely.

407
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:42,500
[Teoritta chuckles]
Our glorious triumphs

408
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:43,800
would surely
have been impossible

409
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:46,460
without my blessings.
I have tried my hardest.

410
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:48,170
Say, do you think
the Holy Knights

411
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:49,470
will be grateful to me?

412
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:52,220
Probably, but try not to get
too carried away.

413
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:53,300
[Teoritta chuckles]

414
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:55,470
[TEORITTA] My brave knight.

415
00:16:55,640 --> 00:16:57,100
Would you perchance entertain

416
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:59,890
the notion of defeating
the demon lord by ourselves?

417
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:01,310
Don’t be stupid.

418
00:17:01,350 --> 00:17:03,980
I have no interest,
and it’s against our orders.

419
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:06,190
[groans]
Please reconsider my offer!

420
00:17:06,230 --> 00:17:08,360
-You have a goddess with you--
-Hell no!

421
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:11,030
Join the Holy Knights
if that’s what you want.

422
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:12,660
[TEORITTA]
Again with this nonsense?

423
00:17:12,950 --> 00:17:14,700
You are my chosen knight.

424
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:17,290
I exist to bestow
blessings upon you!

425
00:17:17,330 --> 00:17:19,710
It is you.
I need you to tell me

426
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:21,750
I am a goddess
of superlative power,

427
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:24,000
or I shall not be satisfied.

428
00:17:24,290 --> 00:17:25,800
-[XYLO] Hmm...
-[chiming]

429
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:28,800
Xylo, communiqué
from the main force.

430
00:17:29,630 --> 00:17:32,590
Don’t tell me.
Is that a distress signal?

431
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,760
[KIVIA]
Hurry, things are dire.

432
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:36,390
We need your help.

433
00:17:36,810 --> 00:17:39,770
We’re low on time,
the Demon Blight,

434
00:17:39,810 --> 00:17:42,310
the Knights...
we’re under attack.

435
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:43,770
[monsters growling]

436
00:17:43,810 --> 00:17:46,940
Incoming! Your orders, Captain?

437
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:48,480
Prepare to engage!

438
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:50,400
[roars]

439
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:53,070
[monsters growling]

440
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:59,080
All forces, charge!

441
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:00,790
[growling]

442
00:18:07,090 --> 00:18:09,300
-[Kivia grunts]
-[monsters grunting]

443
00:18:11,010 --> 00:18:12,050
[gasps]

444
00:18:12,090 --> 00:18:13,930
[growls]

445
00:18:16,180 --> 00:18:17,600
[Xylo panting]

446
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,600
[XYLO] It’s even worse
than I expected.

447
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:22,180
[screaming]

448
00:18:22,230 --> 00:18:24,560
[monster growling]

449
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:27,820
-We could try--
-[TEORITTA] Wait, my knight.

450
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:31,950
Those wayward faeries.

451
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,990
Before they transformed,
they were human.

452
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:38,530
Correct, but now
they’re just knockers.

453
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:41,290
[growling]

454
00:18:41,330 --> 00:18:42,620
[grunts]

455
00:18:43,210 --> 00:18:45,500
[grunts]
Don’t just stand there, fight!

456
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:48,710
Even though I hate it,
I know what I’ve gotta do.

457
00:18:48,750 --> 00:18:50,380
If the Holy Knights
get wiped out,

458
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:52,130
our heads get blown off.

459
00:18:52,260 --> 00:18:53,590
Give the order...

460
00:18:53,630 --> 00:18:55,640
Holy Knight Captain!

461
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,720
[Kivia grunts]

462
00:18:57,050 --> 00:18:58,850
[KIVIA] Xylo Forbartz...

463
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:01,850
Hurry and flank them!

464
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:03,390
[Norgalle grunts]

465
00:19:03,520 --> 00:19:06,600
Onward! Go forth and fight,
my elite royal soldiers!

466
00:19:06,650 --> 00:19:08,980
It is our duty
to bring everlasting slumber

467
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:11,730
to the bewitched subjects
of my kingdom!

468
00:19:12,490 --> 00:19:14,320
[Tatsuya yelling]

469
00:19:17,070 --> 00:19:19,910
[growling]

470
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:22,660
-It’s our turn.
-Those poor souls.

471
00:19:23,250 --> 00:19:26,870
Tell me, can they not return
to the way they were?

472
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,290
[softly] Huh?

473
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:31,630
[TEORITTA]
There are people in the city,

474
00:19:31,710 --> 00:19:34,970
who are anxiously awaiting
their safe return.

475
00:19:36,510 --> 00:19:38,890
Once someone has transformed,

476
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:41,260
there's no going back.

477
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,770
[Xylo grunts] All we can do

478
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:49,360
is put an end
to their suffering.

479
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:53,360
This is it! Charge them!

480
00:19:53,690 --> 00:19:55,900
[monsters growling]

481
00:20:08,250 --> 00:20:09,580
[gags]

482
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:13,960
[KNIGHT 1] That was
a hell of a mission.

483
00:20:14,010 --> 00:20:15,170
[KNIGHT 2] Yeah.

484
00:20:15,210 --> 00:20:17,680
Had no idea humans
could turn into faeries.

485
00:20:18,970 --> 00:20:20,090
[XYLO] What the...

486
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:21,680
[male miner shivering]
Stop...

487
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:23,640
-the voice.
-[XYLO] Hey, are you injured?

488
00:20:23,930 --> 00:20:25,180
Hey!

489
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:27,560
[male miner shivering]
The voice.

490
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:29,900
It won’t stop.

491
00:20:29,940 --> 00:20:31,980
The voice. It calls...

492
00:20:32,980 --> 00:20:35,190
It would appear
there are a few dozen workers

493
00:20:35,230 --> 00:20:37,700
who didn’t make it
out of the tunnel in time.

494
00:20:38,070 --> 00:20:39,410
That sounds miserable.

495
00:20:39,450 --> 00:20:40,990
[NORGALLE] My loyal subjects.

496
00:20:41,030 --> 00:20:44,240
They have sacrificed everything
in service to my kingdom.

497
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:46,330
Thus, we must save them
at any cost!

498
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:47,750
Impossible.

499
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:50,920
Saving civilians isn’t
one of our mission objectives.

500
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:54,210
We simply can’t risk losing
more Holy Knights to help them.

501
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:55,880
[Norgalle gasps]

502
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,260
Tell me something,

503
00:20:57,300 --> 00:20:59,430
purely out of curiosity...

504
00:20:59,930 --> 00:21:03,300
If we were to attempt
a rescue of those civilians,

505
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:06,890
how many of my knights
do you think I would lose?

506
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:11,560
[Xylo scoffs]

507
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:14,310
Guess I’m not the only one
in a tricky position.

508
00:21:15,570 --> 00:21:17,780
I would expect
heavy casualties.

509
00:21:17,820 --> 00:21:19,900
Having to escape
through narrow corridors

510
00:21:19,950 --> 00:21:21,320
while defending civilians

511
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:22,910
-would be--
-[PRIEST] Captain Kivia,

512
00:21:22,950 --> 00:21:24,450
if I may be so bold,

513
00:21:24,490 --> 00:21:27,330
is it really necessary to ask
the opinion of such a man?

514
00:21:27,370 --> 00:21:29,580
We are to use
scorched-earth seals

515
00:21:29,620 --> 00:21:30,870
to close off the tunnels.

516
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:33,670
Remember?
Those were Galtuile’s orders.

517
00:21:35,170 --> 00:21:36,880
I’m well-aware.

518
00:21:37,590 --> 00:21:39,590
[NORGALLE]
You intend to abandon them?

519
00:21:39,630 --> 00:21:41,430
My loyal subjects!

520
00:21:42,090 --> 00:21:44,680
This is treason
of the highest degree!

521
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:45,850
You shall pay.

522
00:21:45,890 --> 00:21:48,020
Your cowardice
is an act of rebellion!

523
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:49,140
Unhand me!

524
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:51,770
[chuckles]
A royal embarrassment.

525
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:54,560
The great Norgalle Senridge,

526
00:21:54,610 --> 00:21:56,480
the last disciple
of Sage Hordeaux,

527
00:21:56,520 --> 00:21:58,280
and the pride of the academy,

528
00:21:58,320 --> 00:22:01,360
reduced to a blathering fool
drowning in madness.

529
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:03,110
You’re all filthy traitors!

530
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:06,370
You will be punished,
by order of my royal decree.

531
00:22:06,410 --> 00:22:07,910
[XYLO] Calm down, Your Majesty.

532
00:22:07,950 --> 00:22:10,370
Do what they say or that seal
on your neck will kill you.

533
00:22:10,410 --> 00:22:12,750
Xylo, are you
turning on me as well?

534
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:14,080
[Xylo sighs]

535
00:22:14,540 --> 00:22:15,580
Uh?

536
00:22:21,840 --> 00:22:22,880
[gasps]

537
00:22:22,930 --> 00:22:24,380
♪

538
00:22:25,050 --> 00:22:26,390
Damn it!

539
00:22:29,100 --> 00:22:31,810
-Stay here. We’ll save them.
-[KIVIA] Uh?

540
00:22:31,850 --> 00:22:33,270
Pardon?

541
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:35,690
[XYLO] We’ve already set up
the front-line base for you.

542
00:22:35,730 --> 00:22:38,190
The Knights can carry out
the mission as ordered.

543
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:41,440
If we don't make it out in time,
just bury us alive in there.

544
00:22:41,490 --> 00:22:43,950
Any fatalities will be limited
to heroes.

545
00:22:43,990 --> 00:22:45,030
[priest chuckles]

546
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,660
Such courage!

547
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:48,530
As expected of my champion!

548
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:51,040
So may I presume the
Holy Knights are in agreeance?

549
00:22:51,080 --> 00:22:52,960
As soon as we succeed
in our rescue,

550
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:55,250
you may join them
in lavishing praise upon us--

551
00:22:55,290 --> 00:22:57,210
-[XYLO] Teoritta stays here.
-Huh?

552
00:22:58,790 --> 00:23:00,300
Think about it.

553
00:23:00,340 --> 00:23:03,220
We can’t let a goddess
be buried alive.

554
00:23:04,090 --> 00:23:06,340
Please, it is imperative
that you reconsider.

555
00:23:06,380 --> 00:23:08,470
We must always remain
with each other, my knight--

556
00:23:08,510 --> 00:23:09,720
[RAJIT] Forgive me, Goddess.

557
00:23:09,760 --> 00:23:12,060
[TEORITTA]
Xylo, you have deceived me!

558
00:23:12,100 --> 00:23:13,930
I demand that
you atone for this!

559
00:23:13,980 --> 00:23:15,350
[Xylo grunts]

560
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:19,110
How can every last one of you
be so damn self-serving?

561
00:23:19,150 --> 00:23:20,440
In all honesty,

562
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:22,940
I don't give a damn
about the civilians.

563
00:23:22,990 --> 00:23:24,200
Doesn’t matter.

564
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:26,450
'Cause I'm mad as hell now...

565
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:29,580
at the commanders
who formed this garbage plan,

566
00:23:29,780 --> 00:23:32,910
and at the people
eagerly awaiting my death.

567
00:23:33,660 --> 00:23:35,290
It’s too late.

568
00:23:35,330 --> 00:23:37,380
I already dug my grave.

569
00:23:37,420 --> 00:23:41,670
Now it’s time to march inside
to the very depths.

570
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:47,550
[♪ closing theme song playing]

571
00:23:57,560 --> 00:23:58,940
THE PRISON RECORDS OF PENAL HERO
UNIT 9004

